    "mnemonic": "<ja>越す</ja> means \"to go beyond.\" <ja>追</ja> is <kanji>follow</kanji>. If you are following someone, and then you go beyond them, you have overtaken them. That's why this word means <vocabulary>to overtake</vocabulary> or <vocabulary>to surpass</vocabulary>.",
